        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES&#10;The six groups are independent entry points, not a mandatory sequence of unrelated tasks.&#10;Use the index to open an individual workflow. Customer and operator actions are separated by responsibility.&#10;External email, payment, push and courier services are shown only in the workflows that use them." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#273142;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
